From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AkaraChen <akarachen@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 09:30:10 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] acpc: app-server protocol extension for ACP concepts

Adds experimental acpc/* methods for ACP features the Codex app-server
protocol has no message for: agent-advertised slash commands, session
config options and modes, notices, the agent list, agent selection,
sign-in method selection and an interactive terminal handoff.

The TUI gains an acpc mode switch (tui/src/acpc.rs, off by default) and
mirrors the extension state on the chat widget. Codex's own app-server
and exec reject the new methods.
